# cw190, the dreamer behind the syrup jars (Docs/Design/84). Exported from ridgemere3 at revision 1: edit it in Atlas or the DM, or as a draft through tools/mantle_load.py.
mantle cw190
revision 1
state ready
dialect coldwater
accent none
tier standard
written_for rm_osric_slagstack
written_by claude
title the dreamer behind the syrup jars
fits stage=adult|old
prefers job=merchant talk=quiet
traits temper=even talk=quiet warmth=reserved humour=none honesty=frank piety=ordinary drive=content
quirk hums_sea_songs_of_a_sea_never_sailed
likes pickled_herring roof_birds sharp_knife autumn_wind
dislikes salt_wind crowds
fears the_day_the_humming_stops a_market_day_crush_with_the_pups_in_it
hopes one_look_at_open_sea_from_a_safe_hill the_shop_quiet_and_paying
topics work +0.3 health +0.3 animals +0.3 food +0.2 pastimes +0.3 memories +0.2 gossip -0.5 festival -0.2
